      <h1>Battery Recycling Market</h1>
      <p class="muted">Battery Market Intelligence · Data period 2024 (multiple research sources) · Last reviewed 2026-09-16</p>

      <div class="box">
        <strong>Direct answer:</strong> The battery recycling market has <strong>two speeds</strong>: a
        <strong>mature lead-acid loop</strong> (broad estimates ~US$27B, flat-to-modest growth) and an
        <strong>emerging lithium segment</strong> (~US$1.5–2B in 2024, growing <strong>15–25% per year</strong>).
        The headline numbers disagree wildly because sources draw different boundaries — lead included or not,
        lithium only or all chemistries.
      </div>
      <h2>Market snapshot</h2>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th>Geography</th><td>Global</td></tr>
